event flow. As a result, your audio rental setup can better match the real needs of your event instead of relying on a one-size-fits-all package.<\/p>\n<p>For general sound planning tips, you can also review this helpful <a href=\"https:\/\/www.shure.com\/en-US\/performance-production\/louder\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">audio and microphone resource from Shure<\/a>.<\/p>\n<h3>Request Audio Rental or Video Services<\/h3>\n<p>If you need Atlanta audio rental, wireless microphones, speakers, lighting, video screens, projector rentals, or event equipment support, JAMMIN&#8217; DJs can help. Tell us your event date, venue, guest count, and equipment needs, and our team will help recommend the right setup.<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"http:\/\/www.myjammindjs.djintelligence.com\/quote\/index.asp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Request Audio Rental Pricing<\/a><\/p>\n<h3>\n\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/jammindjs.net\/dj-lighting-equipment-rental\/\" title=\"CHAUVET INTIMIDATOR 355\"  target=\"_self\">\n\t\t\tCHAUVET INTIMIDATOR 355\t\t<\/a>\n\t<\/h3>\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/jammindjs.net\/dj-lighting-equipment-rental\/\"  target=\"_self\" itemprop=\"url\">\n\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/04\/intimidator-355-5ea9111720e84.jpg\" alt=\"Two LED lights available for audio and lighting rental.\" itemprop=\"image\" title=\"Two LED lights available for audio and lighting rental.\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'\" loading=\"lazy\" \/>\n\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t<p>Intimidator Spot 355 IRC is a feature-packed moving head spot fitted with a 90 W LED. The rotating 3-facet prism can split the beam to expand the coverage area while the manual zoom can increase the throw distance.<\/p>\n\t<a href=\"https:\/\/jammindjs.net\/dj-lighting-equipment-rental\/\" target=\"_self\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Rent It Now\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tRent It Now\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n<h3>\n\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/jammindjs.net\/dj-lighting-equipment-rental\